                    },
                    "contentPath_": "Assets\\Data\\NpcChatText/DesertKunoichi_Cleared.npcChat",
                    "guid_": {
                        "cereal_class_version": 0,
                        "value_": "898E068E-57FF-4ED3-9682-A74B5DA7614A"
                    }
                },
                "count": 6,
                "item_0": {
                    "cereal_class_version": 0,
                    "font_": {
                        "cereal_class_version": 0,
                        "value0": {
                            "polymorphic_id": 1073741824,
                            "ptr_wrapper": {
                                "id": 2147483650,
                                "data": {
                                    "cereal_class_version": 0,
                                    "value0": {
                                        "value_": "02951627-F120-4EDC-B4F7-C27985C7F643"
                                    }
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "text_": "……眠れたんだね。\nありがとう。あんたに頼んでよかった。",
                    "textColor_": {
                        "cereal_class_version": 0,
                        "r_": 255,
                        "g_": 255,
                        "b_": 255
                    }
                },
                "item_1": {
                    "font_": {
                        "value0": {
                            "polymorphic_id": 1073741824,
                            "ptr_wrapper": {
                                "id": 2147483651,
                                "data": {
                                    "value0": {
                                        "value_": "02951627-F120-4EDC-B4F7-C27985C7F643"
                                    }
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "text_": "見たでしょ。心臓が骨に宿って、\n竜が起き上がった。",
                    "textColor_": {
                        "r_": 255,
                        "g_": 255,
                        "b_": 255
                    }
                },
                "item_2": {
                    "font_": {
                        "value0": {
                            "polymorphic_id": 1073741824,
                            "ptr_wrapper": {
                                "id": 2147483652,
                                "data": {
                                    "value0": {
                                        "value_": "02951627-F120-4EDC-B4F7-C27985C7F643"
                                    }
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "text_": "島の心臓は、竜の心臓なんだよ。\n私の島は、あの竜の心臓で浮いてた。",
                    "textColor_": {
                        "r_": 255,
                        "g_": 255,
                        "b_": 255
                    }
                },
                "item_3": {
                    "font_": {
                        "value0": {
                            "polymorphic_id": 1073741824,
                            "ptr_wrapper": {
                                "id": 2147483653,
                                "data": {
                                    "value0": {
                                        "value_": "02951627-F120-4EDC-B4F7-C27985C7F643"
                                    }
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "text_": "あの古竜は、仲間の心臓を\n取り返して回ってるんだと思う。",
                    "textColor_": {
                        "r_": 255,
                        "g_": 255,
                        "b_": 255
                    }
                },
                "item_4": {
                    "font_": {
                        "value0": {
                            "polymorphic_id": 1073741824,
                            "ptr_wrapper": {
                                "id": 2147483654,
                                "data": {
                                    "value0": {
                                        "value_": "02951627-F120-4EDC-B4F7-C27985C7F643"
                                    }
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "text_": "私があの古竜を追うのは、仇だから。\n……でも、それだけじゃなくなった。",
                    "textColor_": {
                        "r_": 255,
                        "g_": 255,
                        "b_": 255
                    }
                },
                "item_5": {
                    "font_": {
                        "value0": {
                            "polymorphic_id": 1073741824,
                            "ptr_wrapper": {
                                "id": 2147483655,
                                "data": {
                                    "value0": {
                                        "value_": "02951627-F120-4EDC-B4F7-C27985C7F643"
                                    }
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "text_": "あんたの島を、この城塞みたいには\nさせない。……私も、手を貸すよ。",
                    "textColor_": {
                        "r_": 255,
                        "g_": 255,
                        "b_": 255
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    }
}